    scenario: 'Over drinks, Leo listens to Ana describe her steady job at the council. He smiles and says she talks about her old travel photography the way people talk about an ex. She laughs it off. A week later he sends her a link to a photography residency in Lisbon, with no comment. She can’t stop thinking about it, or about him.',
